// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
; specs/course/neural-networks.t27 -- the t27 course on neural networks, from one neuron to a transformer block
; Source of truth for apps/website/scripts/course-from-spec.mjs (gHashTag/trinity), which reads
; it the way it reads specs/course/course.t27: the constant schema, every test block below, every
; widget in specs/widgets/gallery.t27, every lesson spec compiled clean, the Russian bundle named
; by specs/course/neural-networks-ru.t27. It writes this course into src/lib/course.generated.ts
; (the page at #/neural-networks) and a byte-identical copy of this file at
; public/learn/neural-networks.t27. ASCII only (L3), English only (LANG-EN).

; WHAT THE COURSE IS: course 10 of specs/course/courses.t27, 27 lessons in 9 modules of 3: one
; neuron, new bends, a layer, pictures, the error, downhill, learning, memory and attention, and
; the transformer and the reward. Every lesson opens one interactive widget and one spec. The
; agents of this project think with neural networks; this course opens their parts as the
; gHashTag/t27 specs/ml specs they are written in, each with numeric tests. Every widget runs the
; fn bodies of one of those specs compiled to WebAssembly (public/widgets/<id>/logic.js, held to
; its spec by scripts/widget-logic.mjs), vendored byte for byte from t27 master 239b4b059; the
; max-pool spec from 2e53089d5, which added out_side (gHashTag/t27#10665) for the nn-maxpool widget.

; WHAT THE COURSE DOES NOT DO: it says no number of its own. Every number in a lesson is one the
; lesson spec computes and its widget shows. Lesson 10 is average pooling, not a convolution: the
; sliding conv2d spec (gHashTag/t27#10612) was not merged when the course was made, and the
; lesson says so. Lesson 20 shows the four inputs of XOR, not a decision region over the plane.

; WHY 27: 3 cubed lessons, the size of a TRI-27 word. Changing the shape changes the tests.
; phi^2 + 1/phi^2 = 3 | TRINITY

